    "河南 · 平顶山宝丰": "Baofeng, Pingdingshan, Henan",
    "北宋晚期 (哲宗、徽宗朝)": "Late Northern Song (Reigns of Zhezong & Huizong)",
    "汝州盛产天然玛瑙矿与优质高岭土，以玛瑙微末入釉，使天青釉质失透如凝脂，晶润似玉。": "Ruzhou abounded in natural agate and fine kaolin; pulverized agate mixed into the glaze yielded an opaque, jade-like sky-blue sheen.",
    "汝窑天青无纹水仙盆、天青釉莲花式温碗": "Ru Sky-Blue Uncrackled Narcissus Bowl & Lotus Warming Bowl",
