    "北宋政和、宣和年间": "Zhenghe & Xuanhe Reigns, Northern Song",
    "黄河故道沉积黏土，含铁量适宜，烧制出沉稳之紫口铁足，专供宋徽宗内廷祭祀陈设。": "Alluvial clays from the old Yellow River course with balanced iron content produced solemn purple-rim iron-foot ritual vessels for Emperor Huizong's court.",
    "官窑八方弦纹贯耳瓶、穿带壶": "Guan Octagonal Cordoned Tubular-Ear Vase & Belted Ewer",
