    "禹州神垕镇特有的孔雀石与红铜矿石，经还原焰窑变析出红、蓝、紫微晶，万彩纷呈。": "Local malachite and cuprite ores from Shenhou transmuted in reduction flames into swirling red, blue, and purple microcrystalline splashes.",
    "钧窑玫瑰紫出戟海棠尊、鼓钉洗": "Jun Rose-Purple Flanged Begonia Zun & Drum-Nail Brush Washer",
