    "杭州凤凰山紫金土含铁量高达5%，形成典型薄胎厚釉与紫黑铁足，釉层达三至四层之多。": "Mt. Fenghuang Zijintu clay with up to 5% iron yielded thin bodies, multi-layered thick glazes (3–4 coats), and dark iron-black feet.",
    "修内司官窑八方贯耳瓶、冰裂纹盘口瓶": "Xiuneisi Guan Octagonal Tubular-Ear Vase & Ice-Crackle Dish-Mouth Vase",
