    "深铁褐色高含铁量胎土，配合高膨胀系数石灰碱釉，形成大黑小黄的“金丝铁线”开片绝艺。": "Iron-rich dark brown clay paired with high-expansion lime-alkali glaze creates the famed 'Gold Threads and Iron Wires' dual crackle.",
