    "漆水河流域富铝黏土，釉面呈透明度极高的橄榄青色，半刀泥刻花犀利刚劲。": "Alumina-rich Qishui River clay under crystalline olive-green glaze, celebrated for crisp half-knife-cut carved decoration.",
    "耀州窑青釉刻花缠枝牡丹纹碗、倒装壶": "Yaozhou Carved Peony Celadon Bowl & Inverted Ewer",
