    "高白度氧化钾软质高岭土，烧出乳白温润如象牙之“中国白 (Blanc de Chine)”。": "High-potash pure white kaolin fired into creamy, ivory-warm porcelain known in Europe as 'Blanc de Chine.'",
    "何朝宗制白釉观音坐像、达摩渡海像": "He Chaozong Seated Guanyin & Bodhidharma Crossing the Sea",
