    "曹娥江流域富铁硅酸盐，高温还原焰烧出如冰似玉之“秘色瓷”。": "Iron-rich Cao'e River silicates fired in sealed porcelain saggars produced ice-and-jade 'Secret-Color' (Mise) celadon.",
    "法门寺地宫出土秘色瓷八棱净水瓶、越窑青瓷瓜棱壶": "Famen Temple Mise Octagonal Bottle & Yue Melon-Lobed Ewer",
    "青瓷始祖 · 九秋风露越窑开": "Progenitor of Celadon · 'In Autumn Winds the Yue Kilns Open'",
