    "隋唐五代": "Sui, Tang & Five Dynasties",
    "内丘优质高硅透光瓷土，大唐盛世确立“南青北白”之北方白瓷领袖。": "Translucent high-silica Neiqiu clay established Xing as the northern white porcelain leader in the Tang 'South Celadon, North White' paradigm.",
    "邢窑白瓷“盈”字款执壶、卷唇带把执壶": "Xing White Porcelain 'Ying'-Marked Ewer & Rolled-Rim Ewer",
