    "湘江河滩红黏土，首创釉下褐绿彩绘与诗文题字，黑石号沉船外销主力。": "Xiang River red clay pioneering underglaze brown-green painting and calligraphy—a mainstay of the Belitung shipwreck export cargo.",
    "黑石号沉船出水釉下彩绘执壶、诗文瓷壶": "Belitung Wreck Underglaze Painted Ewer & Poem-Inscribed Ewer",
