    "北宋晚期 (徽宗朝)": "Late Northern Song (Emperor Huizong Reign)",
    "香灰胎 (极其纯净灰白致密胎骨)": "Incense-Ash Body (Ultra-Pure Dense Pale-Gray Clay)",
    "玛瑙入釉天青厚釉 (寥若晨星，如羊脂美玉)": "Agate-Infused Sky-Blue Thick Glaze (Sparse Bubbles, Mutton-Fat Jade Sheen)",
