    "金地珐琅洋彩锦上添花": "Gold-Ground Enamel Yangcai Brocade-on-Brocade",
    "外瓶透雕镂空开光，内胆同心旋转": "Reticulated Outer Body with Concentric Rotating Inner Core",
    "多次入窑 (1300℃高温胎体 + 800℃低温彩烧)": "Multi-Stage Firing (1300°C Porcelain + 800°C Overglaze Enamels)",
