    "“雨过天青云破处，这般颜色做将来。” —— 华夏器道 · 天青泥火数字造物工坊监制": "\"Where the sky clears after rain among broken clouds.\" — Certified by Vessels of China Studio",
    "🎉 已为您生成并导出《专属数字藏品收藏证书》高清海报！": "🎉 Generated & exported your HD Digital Collectible Certificate Poster!",
    "🌈 已切换至【多光谱微应力热力场】：红黄为高应力开片裂缝密集区，幽蓝为平滑致密区": "🌈 Switched to [Multispectral Stress Heatmap]: Red/yellow marks high crackle density; blue marks smooth zones",
