    "数字化研考按语": "Digital Research Commentary",
    "此器物造型沉穆端庄，其釉汁层层厚施，微观100倍显微镜下可见特征气泡层与矿物结晶，属两宋至明初皇家御用或数字孪生典范之作。": "Balanced, dignified silhouette clad in multi-layered glaze; 100x microscopy reveals characteristic bubble strata and mineral crystals typical of Song-to-early-Ming imperial masterworks.",
