    "通高 22.8 cm · 口径 6.2 cm": "Height 22.8 cm · Rim Dia. 6.2 cm",
    "雨过天青云破处，这般颜色做将来。": "Where the sky clears after rain among broken clouds—make that exact color.",
    "天青泥火 · 华夏古瓷三维孪生数字藏品卡": "Tianqing Nihuo · 3D Digital Twin Collectible Card",
    "天青": "Tianqing",
