    "叩瓷主频：": "Fundamental Tone:",
    "宋韵数字藏品明信片 · 装裱预览": "Song Digital Collectible Postcard · Mounted Preview",
    "下载高清装裱明信片 (PNG)": "Download HD Mounted Postcard (PNG)",
    "📜 已下载高清宋韵数字藏品明信片！": "📜 Downloaded HD Song Digital Collectible Postcard!",
    "数字文博藏品卡": "Digital Museum Card",
    "一键装裱当前 3D 器物快照、朱红篆印与学术档案": "One-click mount of the current 3D snapshot, vermilion seal & scholarly dossier",
    "未检索到匹配的器物、窑口或釉色，请尝试搜索“汝窑”、“苏麻离青”、“冰裂”、“贯耳瓶”": "No matching vessels, kilns, or glazes found. Try 'Ru Kiln', 'Sumaliqing', 'Crackle', or 'Vase'.",
    "Fe₂O₃ 高温还原显色": "High-Temp Fe₂O₃ Reduction Chromophore",
    "复制色值": "Copy Hex",
    "同步至 3D 展厅试烧": "Sync to 3D Gallery Kiln",
    "已成功复制传统古瓷釉色色值：": "Copied traditional porcelain glaze color:",
    "色值：": "Hex:",
    "Fe₂O₃ + CO (1250℃ 强还原焰) → 2FeO (二价铁青瓷显色) + CO₂↑": "Fe₂O₃ + CO (1250°C Strong Reduction) -> 2FeO (Ferrous Celadon Hue) + CO₂↑",
    "微量二价铁离子（Fe²⁺）在硅酸盐网络中吸收红光波段，配合玛瑙隐晶质瑞利散射，呈现温润失透的天青玉色。": "Trace Fe²⁺ ions in the silicate glass absorb red wavelengths while agate micro-inclusions scatter blue light, yielding opaque sky-blue jade.",
    "明宣德御窑 · 苏麻离青钴蓝釉相": "Ming Xuande Imperial Kiln · Sumaliqing Cobalt Blue",
    "CoO + Al₂O₃ (1300℃ 柴窑还原) → CoAl₂O₄ (尖晶石深邃钴蓝) + Fe₃O₄ (铁锈结晶斑)": "CoO + Al₂O₃ (1300°C Wood Reduction) -> CoAl₂O₄ (Cobalt Spinel Blue) + Fe₃O₄ (Iron-Rust Crystals)",
    "进口高铁低锰苏麻离青钴料在高温下形成稳定的钴铝尖晶石结构，浓重处过饱和铁氧化物析出银黑色磁铁矿结晶斑。": "High-iron, low-manganese Sumaliqing cobalt forms stable CoAl₂O₄ spinel blue, precipitating silvery-black magnetite crystals where supersaturated.",
    "河南禹州钧官窑 · 玫瑰紫海棠红窑变釉": "Yuzhou Imperial Jun Kiln · Rose-Purple & Crabapple Red",
    "2CuO + CO (1280℃ 还原分相) → Cu₂O / Cu⁰ (纳米金属铜胶体粒子) + CO₂↑": "2CuO + CO (1280°C Phase-Sep. Reduction) -> Cu₂O / Cu⁰ (Colloidal Copper Nanoparticles) + CO₂↑",
    "还原焰下铜离子还原为纳米级胶体铜粒子（表面等离子体共振吸收绿光显紫红），与二液分相天蓝乳光交融出晚霞万彩。": "Copper reduces into colloidal Cu⁰ nanoparticles (plasmonic crimson-violet) blending with phase-separated sky-blue opalescence.",
    "高温铜绿釉 · 氧化焰翡翠绿相": "High-Temp Copper Green · Oxidation Emerald Phase",
    "CuO + O₂ (1260℃ 氧化气氛) → Cu²⁺ (二价铜离子配位吸收红光显翠绿)": "CuO + O₂ (1260°C Oxidation) -> Cu²⁺ (Cupric Coordination Emerald Green)",
    "在富氧氧化焰中，铜以二价离子（Cu²⁺）形态溶解于釉玻璃相，无法生成红紫胶体铜，故呈现清澈翠绿色。": "In oxygen-rich firing, copper remains dissolved as Cu²⁺ ions rather than colloidal Cu⁰, yielding clear emerald green.",
    "福建建阳建窑 · 乌金兔毫曜变黑釉": "Jianyang Jian Kiln · Obsidian Hare's-Fur & Yohen Black",
    "3Fe₂O₃ + CO (1310℃ 析晶还原) → 2Fe₃O₄ (乌金底釉) + ε-Fe₂O₃ (兔毫/曜变微晶析出)": "3Fe₂O₃ + CO (1310°C Crystalline Reduction) -> 2Fe₃O₄ (Obsidian Ground) + ε-Fe₂O₃ (Hare's-Fur / Yohen Crystals)",
    "超8%高含铁量使釉层深邃如墨，高温降温阶段过饱和铁质沿流釉方向析出针状赤铁矿与磁铁矿微晶，产生薄膜干涉虹彩。": "Over 8% iron makes the glaze ink-black; cooling precipitates needle-like ε-Fe₂O₃ and magnetite crystals producing thin-film iridescence.",
    "河北曲阳定窑 · 象牙白温润暖釉": "Quyang Ding Kiln · Warm Ivory-White Glaze",
    "Al₂O₃-SiO₂ + 微量 TiO₂/Fe³⁺ (1320℃ 氧化焰) → 象牙暖白透明钙镁釉": "Al₂O₃-SiO₂ + Trace TiO₂/Fe³⁺ (1320°C Oxidation) -> Warm Ivory Clear Calcia-Magnesia Glaze",
    "极低含铁量配合氧化焰气氛，微量三价铁与钛离子赋予白瓷柔和的象牙米白暖调，褪去冷白刺目之感。": "Ultra-low iron fired in oxidation pairs with trace TiO₂ and Fe³⁺ to impart a soft ivory cream warmth free of chalky glare.",
    "宋官钧/景德镇 · 月白莹霜冷韵釉": "Song Imperial Jun / Jingdezhen · Moonlight-White Frost",
    "低铁硅酸盐釉 + CO (弱还原焰) → 极淡 Fe²⁺ 月白莹霜玉相": "Low-Iron Silicate + CO (Mild Reduction) -> Trace Fe²⁺ Cool Moonlight-White Jade",
    "微量二价铁在还原气氛下消除黄色调，呈现白中泛冷青的中秋月白光泽。": "Trace Fe²⁺ under mild reduction neutralizes yellow tones to leave luminous white suffused with cool moonlit blue.",
    "越窑/耀州窑系 · 氧化焰艾叶青黄釉": "Yue / Yaozhou Tradition · Oxidized Mugwort Olive-Yellow",
    "4FeO + O₂ (氧化气氛) → 2Fe₂O₃ (三价铁 Fe³⁺ 显琵琶黄/艾青色)": "4FeO + O₂ (Oxidation) -> 2Fe₂O₃ (Ferric Fe³⁺ Loquat-Yellow / Mugwort Olive)",
    "当窑门密封不严或采用氧化焰烧制时，二价铁被氧化为三价铁（Fe³⁺），青瓷即由天青转为温润的艾叶青黄或琵琶色。": "When oxygen enters or oxidizing firing is used, Fe²⁺ oxidizes to Fe³⁺, shifting celadon from sky blue to warm olive-ochre.",
    "南宋龙泉/修内司官窑 · 梅子青与粉青厚釉": "S. Song Longquan / Guan · Plum & Powder Celadon Thick Glaze",
    "Fe₂O₃ (2.5%+) + CO (还原焰) + CaO-K₂O 石灰碱釉 → 翠玉粉青相": "Fe₂O₃ (2.5%+) + CO (Reduction) + CaO-K₂O Lime-Alkali Glaze -> Emerald Powder Celadon",
    "较高二价铁浓度配合高粘度石灰碱厚釉与微气泡散射，呈现饱满欲滴的粉青与梅子青玉质光泽。": "Higher Fe²⁺ concentration in viscous lime-alkali glaze with microbubble scattering creates lush, saturated emerald-jade depth.",
    "东方古瓷釉色": "Eastern Ceramic Glaze",
