    "雨过天青云破处，这般颜色做将来。融合 1:1 实测古瓷三维扫描孪生、程序化 HDR 穹顶光影、双层玻璃相清漆着色器、Voronoi 热应力冰裂开片与 X 光胎骨剖面解构，邀您步入虚实交融的千年名窑殿堂": "Where the sky clears after rain among broken clouds—capture that celestial hue in porcelain. Integrating 1:1 laser-scanned museum twins, procedural HDR dome lighting, dual-layer glass clearcoat shaders, Voronoi thermal-stress crackle, and X-ray cross-sectioning.",
