    "中国古代视精瓷如美玉，“声如磬，清脆越人”。点击上方音阶，体验宫商角徵羽与名瓷共振的空灵之美": "Ancient China prized fine porcelain like jade—'clear and resonant as a stone chime.' Click the notes above to hear pentatonic resonance.",
