    "陶轮一转天地开，素手揉出万象来” ——《天工开物 · 陶埏篇": "One turn of the potter's wheel opens heaven and earth; bare hands shape ten thousand forms.\" — Tiangong Kaiwu",
    "陶轮拉坯是传统手工制瓷最具生命力的核心工序。匠人将练好的熟泥掷于旋转转盘中心，以双手拇指开孔，四指提拉外壁。利用离心力与指尖均匀推压，将致密泥料顺势拔高，器物之口沿、修颈、溜肩、圆腹在此一气呵成": "Wheel throwing is the most vital stage of traditional porcelain making. The potter centers wedged clay on the spinning wheel, opens the core with both thumbs, and draws up the wall with balanced pressure—forming rim, neck, shoulder, and belly in one continuous motion.",
    "纯前端声学算法振荡与环境白噪音，可叠加开启，营造沉浸式研学雅境": "Pure frontend acoustic synthesis and ambient noise—layer freely to create an immersive study atmosphere",
