    "约 1200℃–1230℃ (还原焰": "c. 1200°C–1230°C (Reduction",
    "满釉裹足支钉烧造 (五枚如粟微小芝麻支钉": "Full-Glaze Spur Firing (Five Millet-Tiny Sesame Spurs",
