    "📸 已导出带博物馆朱印题签的 3D 典藏高清快照": "📸 Exported HD 3D collection snapshot with vermilion museum seal!",
    "[three-fx] 环境贴图生成失败，回退无环境光": "three-fx] Environment map failed; falling back to ambient-free lighting",
