    "未检索到匹配的器物、窑口或釉色，请尝试搜索“汝窑”、“苏麻离青”、“冰裂”、“贯耳瓶": "No matching vessels, kilns, or glazes found. Try 'Ru Kiln', 'Sumaliqing', 'Crackle', or 'Vase'.",
    "已成功复制传统古瓷釉色色值": "Copied traditional porcelain glaze color",
